OL,3,GNEWSAThatchers warn of growing straw
OL,4,Ashortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FThatchers have warned they are facing a
OL,7,Fgrowing shortage of straw that is
OL,8,Fputting them out of work for months at
OL,9,Fa time.
OL,11,FThe traditional trade is responsible
OL,12,Ffor maintaining some of Oxfordshire's
OL,13,Fmost recognisable homes but they told
OL,14,Fthe BBC that finding enough suitable
OL,15,Fmaterial was becoming increasingly
OL,16,Fdifficult.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
