OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1788933377
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThatchers warn of growing straw
OL,4,Ashortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Pike, from Thame Thatch, said the
OL,7,Flack of straw was having a huge impact
OL,8,Fon his work and the homes waiting to be
OL,9,Fthatched, adding: "We're just into a
OL,10,Fnew harvest but by April we'll run out
OL,11,Fof straw again."
OL,13,FThe government advisory body Historic
OL,14,FEngland said it understood the
OL,15,Fchallenges and had been "engaging
OL,16,Fclosely with the sector on these issues
OL,17,Fover recent years".
